msgstr ""
"**Nom** : *Carte-couronne*, **Type** : *Carte-couronne* (déjà choisi), "
"**Valeur (CHF)** : *10*"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: ../src/help/en/getting-started/first-event.md:64
msgid "**Elite**: *360*, **Senior**: *355*"
msgstr "**Élite** : *360*, **Seniors** : *355*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/getting-started/first-event.md:66
